# Security rules (V9–V10, V15)

## V9 — No committed credentials

Never commit API keys, tokens, or passwords in:
- `application.properties`
- `application-*.properties`
- Any file under `src/`

Use environment variables or external secret stores for production config.

## V10 — No secrets in logs

Do not log credentials, tokens, or full connection strings. Payload JSON must not include secrets.

## V15 — No build artifacts in git

Never commit:
- `target/`
- `metrics-collector.log*`
- `smoke-*.log`
- `.DS_Store`

See `docs/REPO_HYGIENE.md`.
